Package: metrosp
Type: Package
Title: São Paulo Metro System Data
Version: 2.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Vinicius", "Oike",
      email = "viniciusoike@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
      comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-8015-9189")
    )
  )
Description: Passenger demand and train service data for the São Paulo
    metro system, by line and by station, with spatial geometries for metro
    and commuter train lines and stations. The bundled datasets are a fixed
    snapshot. read_metro_demand() and read_metro_service() download and
    cache more recent data from 'GitHub' releases.
